' Explicit inheritance
LibraryService --|> LibraryCatalog
DuplicateDocumentError --|> ValueError
DocumentNotFoundError --|> LookupError
DocumentSummaryNotFoundError --|> LookupError
QuestionBankNotFoundError --|> LookupError
StudyQuestionNotFoundError --|> LookupError
ImportStatus --|> StrEnum
ReviewRating --|> StrEnum

' Ingestion and chunking
Document *-- "1..*" Page
PdfHandle o-- "1..*" PdfPage
PdfExtractor --> PdfHandle : opens
PdfExtractor ..|> DocumentExtractor
TextChunker --> Page : processes
TextChunker --> Chunk : creates

' Retrieval and indexing
SentenceTransformerEmbedder ..|> Embedder
SentenceTransformerEmbedder --> SentenceTransformerModel
InMemoryVectorStore ..|> VectorStore
FaissVectorStore ..|> VectorStore
RetrievalService o-- Embedder
RetrievalService o-- VectorStore
RetrievalService --> SearchResult : returns
SearchResult *-- Chunk
RetrievalService ..|> RetrievalGateway
RetrievalService ..|> SearchGateway
FaissVectorStore ..|> DocumentChunkReader
DocumentSearchService ..|> DocumentIndexer
DocumentSearchService o-- TextChunker
DocumentSearchService o-- RetrievalGateway
DocumentSearchService --> Document
DocumentSearchService --> Chunk

' Library and document lifecycle
SqliteDocumentRepository ..|> DocumentRepository
SqliteDocumentRepository ..|> SummaryDocumentLookup
SqliteDocumentRepository ..|> QuestionBankDocumentLookup
LibraryCatalog o-- DocumentRepository
LibraryService o-- DocumentExtractor
LibraryService o-- DocumentIndexer
LibraryService o-- "0..*" DocumentDerivedDataCleaner
LibraryService ..|> DocumentLibrary
BatchImportService o-- DocumentLibrary
BatchImportService --> ImportOutcome
ImportOutcome o-- IndexedDocument

' Generation models and persistence
GroundedAnswer *-- "0..*" Citation
